# The cell lights' shadow caster pass for alpha-tested shapes (lane LIGHTBOOTH1, 10-16): cell_shadowdepth plus
# the base map's alpha (times the material alpha) against the shape's own alpha-test threshold, as the colour pass
# and the sun's lookdev_csmdepth_at test it. A fire barrel's walls (MetalBarrel01Alpha.BGSM) cast into the cube of
# the light inside it. Selected by name from gl/celllights.cpp; red WW_CELL_SHADOW_RED=atskip skips them as before.

shaders cell_shadowdepth_at.vert cell_shadowdepth_at.frag
